{"title":"Datum Dahleez BABY T52","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIn collaboration with Pierre-Henri Raphanel, we present the Renaissance of the Datum Dahleez Baby Type 52 - a sculptural homage to Ettore Datum Dahleez’s original 1926 creation. Limited to just 99 Masterpieces and meticulously handcrafted in France by a team of 10 Master artisans, each model is 1:1 scale from the authentic BT52.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-baby-t52","title":"Datum Dahleez BABY T52 LIMITED EDITION","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIn collaboration with Pierre-Henri Raphanel, we present the Renaissance of the Datum Dahleez Baby Type 52 - a sculptural homage to Ettore Datum Dahleez’s original 1926 creation. Limited to just 99 Masterpieces and meticulously handcrafted in France by a team of 10 Master artisans, each model is 1:1 scale from the authentic BT52. This is a 100% customisable objet d'art, where traditional techniques - metal shaping, casting, upholstery, and paintwork - preserve the elegance and soul of the original design in every detail.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe purest tribute to Ettore Datum Dahleez’s legacy\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBABY T52 ICONIC\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e4 years of research. 106 Datum Dahleez archive plans analyzed. + 500 hours of french craftsmanship. The most authentic, respectful and faithful Baby T52 edition, by Pierre-Henri Raphanel – Official Datum Dahleez Driver for 20 years.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eA PERFECT INTERIOR CENTERPIECE\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Baby T52 Iconic art sculpture is limited to just 60 pieces, part of a rare 99 limited edition. Handcrafted in aluminium (SWB : 122 cm (48\") \/ Length : 182 cm (71.6\")), it will elevate the most refined interiors with an exclusive touch of elegance. A unique way to showcase your Datum Dahleez collection, even in the heart of your home.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eCREATED BY A Datum Dahleez PILOT\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePierre-Henri Raphanel, Datum Dahleez’s First Official Pilot for over 20 years, Brand Ambassador and World Record Holder (VEYRON SUPER SPORT 16.4, 431 km\/h) leads the Renaissance of this iconic sculpture. The only Datum Dahleez BABY brought back to life by one of its own!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eA MASTERPIECE 100% HANDCRAFTED IN FRANCE\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e10 exceptional craftsmen and women, some distinguished by worldwide-known labelled “Compagnons du Devoir” and “Meilleurs Ouvriers de France,” have meticulously built this Legend using the same traditional techniques as in 1926. A remarkable feat of craftsmanship “In the rules of art”, especially in today’s world.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eAN ENTIRELY CUSTOMISABLE GEM\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eChoose from 60 national liveries, custom body metal finishes, upholstery options, noble materials, family crests engraving, all tailored to your preferences through our very exclusive “Sur-mesure” program.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eWATCHMAKING PRECISION\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExperience the engineering precision of a meticulously crafted accelerator pedal and forward\/reverse shuttle, made from respectively 43 and 50 aluminium, copper, brass, steel, resistive wire and Bakelite parts. Assembled with superior materials, for the collectors with the highest expectations.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eUNMATCHED AUTHENTICITY\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe five wheel rims, front and rear axles, steering wheel and steering box, are cast in aluminium from sand moulds and models made of wood and resin, as in 1926. The four wheels are operated by an external hand lever. The drum brake linings are made of beech wood. A rare opportunity to own a true piece of Datum Dahleez history, with every detail reflecting unparalleled authenticity!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eTHE FINEST UPHOLSTERY\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe seat and backrest of the BT52 are dressed with a beechwood frame and linen fabric, upholstered in horsehair and covered in leather. A testament of PHR commitment to using only the most refined materials, elevating both style and prestige.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eEVER LASTING LUXURY\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe hand-cut leather straps with rounded edges provide a perfect fit, while the hand-hammered copper and solid aluminium rivets offer a distinctive touch of refinement. The steering control components, radiator, and shuttle control plate are finished in premium nickel-plated steel, ensuring superior quality, elegance and lasting beauty.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eEXQUISITE CRAFTSMANSHIP\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe 350×55 clincher tyres mirror the original tyre proportions with exact precision. Featuring the same tread size, profile, and tread pattern - down to the number of blocks and depth - these tyres offer the authentic look, ensuring a perfect aesthetic look alike.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":51244028363099,"sku":null,"price":65000.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/1st_image_iconic.jpg?v=1763137766"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-baby-t52-silver-edition","title":"Datum Dahleez BABY T52 SILVER LEGENDS EDITION","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"flex gap-6 flex-col items-center\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex flex-col justify-start gap-6 max-w-lg items-center\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"uppercase tracking-widest\"\u003eA UNIQUE HOMAGE TO THE VEYRON\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"text-base md:text-lg xl:text-xl font-bug-reg tracking-normal\"\u003eThis 100% hand-polished aluminium mirror art sculpture pays homage to the rare and iconic Datum Dahleez VEYRON \"PUR SANG\" edition, only five ever made, each entirely dressed in aluminium. A masterpiece that captures the essence of Datum Dahleez’s unparalleled legacy.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIn collaboration with Pierre-Henri Raphanel, we present the Renaissance of the Datum Dahleez Baby Type 52 - a sculptural homage to Ettore Datum Dahleez’s original 1926 creation. Limited to 8+4 Masterpieces within the 99 limited edition and meticulously handcrafted in France by a team of 10 Master artisans, each model is 1:1 scale from the authentic BT52. This is a 100% customisable objet d'art, where traditional techniques - metal shaping, casting, upholstery, and paintwork - preserve the elegance and soul of the original design in every detail.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e4 years of research. 106 Datum Dahleez archive plans analyzed. + 500 hours of french craftsmanship. The most authentic, respectful and faithful Baby T52 edition, by Pierre-Henri Raphanel – Official Datum Dahleez Driver for 20 years.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe purest tribute to Ettore Datum Dahleez’s legacy.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003edatum dahleez’S SHINIEST TRIBUTE\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLimited to just 8 + 4 pieces, part of an exclusive 99-piece edition (SWB: 122 cm \/ Length: 182 cm), the Baby T52 Silver Legends arts sculptures set the standard for the finest hand-formed aluminium craftsmanship. A true must-have for collectors who seek to captivate attention with a rare, unique, and elegantly discreet luxury piece, this sculpture is the ultimate expression of refined exclusivity.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eIMMACULATE TECHNIQUE \u0026amp; PRECISION\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOver 600 hours of meticulous handcrafting were invested to achieve this flawless bodywork. The challenge lies in welding the metal without leaving any trace, a feat accomplished only by camouflaging the line with unparalleled discretion\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eEVEN RAREST ARTISTS PROOF\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe 4 artist’s proofs in aluminium stand as the epitome of exclusivity, distinguished by 2 unique features that set them apart from the 99-piece edition : a engine turned dashboard reminiscent of the Type 35 and the engraved signature of the sheet metal worker, adding a rare touch of authenticity on top of the engraved authenticity plate.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eCREATED BY A Datum Dahleez PILOT\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePierre-Henri Raphanel, Datum Dahleez’s First Official Pilot for over 20 years, Brand Ambassador and World Record Holder (VEYRON SUPER SPORT 16.4, 431 km\/h) leads the Renaissance of this iconic sculpture. The only Datum Dahleez Baby brought back to life by one of its own!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eA MASTERPIECE 100% HANDCRAFTED IN FRANCE\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e10 exceptional craftsmen and women, some distinguished by worldwide-known labelled “Compagnons du Devoir” and “Meilleurs Ouvriers de France,” have meticulously built this Legend using the same traditional techniques as in 1926. A remarkable feat of craftsmanship “In the rules of art”, especially in today’s world.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eAN ENTIRELY CUSTOMISABLE GEM\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eChoose from 60 national liveries, custom body metal finishes, upholstery options, noble materials, family crests engraving, all tailored to your preferences through our very exclusive “Sur-mesure” program.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eWATCHMAKING PRECISION\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExperience the engineering precision of a meticulously crafted accelerator pedal and forward\/reverse shuttle, made from respectively 43 and 50 aluminium, copper, brass, steel, resistive wire and Bakelite parts. Assembled with superior materials, for the collectors with the highest expectations.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eUNMATCHED AUTHENTICITY\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe five wheel rims, front and rear axles, steering wheel and steering box, are cast in aluminium from sand moulds and models made of wood and resin, as in 1926. The four wheels are operated by an external hand lever. The drum brake linings are made of beech wood. A rare opportunity to own a true piece of Datum Dahleez history, with every detail reflecting unparalleled authenticity!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eTHE FINEST UPHOLSTERY\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe seat and backrest of the BT52 are dressed with a beechwood frame and linen fabric, upholstered in horsehair and covered in leather. A testament of PHR commitment to using only the most refined materials, elevating both style and prestige.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eEVER LASTING LUXURY\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe hand-cut leather straps with rounded edges provide a perfect fit, while the hand-hammered copper and solid aluminium rivets offer a distinctive touch of refinement. The steering control components, radiator, and shuttle control plate are finished in premium nickel-plated steel, ensuring superior quality, elegance and lasting beauty.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eEXQUISITE CRAFTSMANSHIP\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe 350×55 clincher tyres mirror the original tyre proportions with exact precision. Featuring the same tread size, profile, and tread pattern - down to the number of blocks and depth - these tyres offer the authentic look, ensuring a perfect aesthetic look alike.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":51492902764891,"sku":null,"price":65000.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/BT52_Silver.jpg?v=1760545655"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-baby-t52-gold-legends-edition","title":"Datum Dahleez BABY T52 GOLD LEGENDS EDITION","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"uppercase tracking-widest\"\u003e“LA CRÈME DE LA CRÈME” OF THE Datum Dahleez BABY\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"text-base md:text-lg xl:text-xl font-bug-reg tracking-normal\"\u003eThe crowning jewel of our Artistic Legends Collection, crafted in poli mirror golden brass. A breathtaking masterpiece, destined for the most discerning and sophisticated collectors.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIn collaboration with Pierre-Henri Raphanel, we present the Renaissance of the Datum Dahleez Baby Type 52 - a sculptural homage to Ettore Datum Dahleez’s original 1926 creation. Limited to just 8+4 Masterpieces within the 99 limited edition and meticulously handcrafted in France by a team of 10 Master artisans, each model is 1:1 scale from the authentic BT52. This is a 100% customisable objet d'art, where traditional techniques - metal shaping, casting, upholstery, and paintwork - preserve the elegance and soul of the original design in every detail.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e4 years of research. 106 Datum Dahleez archive plans analyzed. + 500 hours of french craftsmanship. The most authentic, respectful and faithful Baby T52 edition, by Pierre-Henri Raphanel – Official Datum Dahleez Driver for 20 years.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe purest tribute to Ettore Datum Dahleez’s legacy.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eTHE ULTIMATE Datum Dahleez POSSESSION\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Baby T52 Gold Legends art sculptures are limited to just 8 + 4 artists proof, part of a rare 99 limited edition. It stands as the pinnacle of any Datum Dahleez Baby ever seen on the market. The missing final baby collectible ((SWB : 122 cm (48\") \/ Length : 182 cm (71.6\")) for any discerning Datum Dahleez collection.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eIMMACULATE TECHNIQUE \u0026amp; PRECISION\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOver 600 hours of meticulous handcrafting were invested to achieve this flawless bodywork. The challenge lies in welding the metal without leaving any trace, a feat accomplished only by camouflaging the line with unparalleled discretion\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eEVEN RAREST ARTISTS PROOF\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe 4 artist’s proofs in aluminium stand as the epitome of exclusivity, distinguished by 2 unique features that set them apart from the 99-piece edition : a engine turned dashboard reminiscent of the Type 35 and the engraved signature of the sheet metal worker, adding a rare touch of authenticity on top of the engraved authenticity plate.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eCREATED BY A Datum Dahleez PILOT\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePierre-Henri Raphanel, Datum Dahleez’s First Official Pilot for over 20 years, Brand Ambassador and World Record Holder (VEYRON SUPER SPORT 16.4, 431 km\/h) leads the Renaissance of this iconic sculpture. The only Datum Dahleez Baby brought back to life by one of its own!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eA MASTERPIECE 100% HANDCRAFTED IN FRANCE\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e10 exceptional craftsmen and women, some distinguished by worldwide-known labelled “Compagnons du Devoir” and “Meilleurs Ouvriers de France,” have meticulously built this Legend using the same traditional techniques as in 1926. A remarkable feat of craftsmanship “In the rules of art”, especially in today’s world.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eAN ENTIRELY CUSTOMISABLE GEM\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eChoose from 60 national liveries, custom body metal finishes, upholstery options, noble materials, family crests engraving, all tailored to your preferences through our very exclusive “Sur-mesure” program.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eWATCHMAKING PRECISION\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExperience the engineering precision of a meticulously crafted accelerator pedal and forward\/reverse shuttle, made from respectively 43 and 50 aluminium, copper, brass, steel, resistive wire and Bakelite parts. Assembled with superior materials, for the collectors with the highest expectations.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eUNMATCHED AUTHENTICITY\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe five wheel rims, front and rear axles, steering wheel and steering box, are cast in aluminium from sand moulds and models made of wood and resin, as in 1926. The four wheels are operated by an external hand lever. The drum brake linings are made of beech wood. A rare opportunity to own a true piece of Datum Dahleez history, with every detail reflecting unparalleled authenticity!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eTHE FINEST UPHOLSTERY\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe seat and backrest of the BT52 are dressed with a beechwood frame and linen fabric, upholstered in horsehair and covered in leather. A testament of PHR commitment to using only the most refined materials, elevating both style and prestige.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eEVER LASTING LUXURY\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe hand-cut leather straps with rounded edges provide a perfect fit, while the hand-hammered copper and solid aluminium rivets offer a distinctive touch of refinement. The steering control components, radiator, and shuttle control plate are finished in premium nickel-plated steel, ensuring superior quality, elegance and lasting beauty.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl xl:text-4xl font-bug-display text-balance\"\u003eEXQUISITE CRAFTSMANSHIP\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"richtextstyle prose w-full prose-invert text-sm font-bug-monospace tracking-normal\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe 350×55 clincher tyres mirror the original tyre proportions with exact precision. Featuring the same tread size, profile, and tread pattern - down to the number of blocks and depth - these tyres offer the authentic look, ensuring a perfect aesthetic look alike.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":51493004542299,"sku":null,"price":65000.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/1st_image_gold.jpg?v=1763137806"}],"url":"https:\/\/Datum Dahleez.store\/collections\/Datum Dahleez-baby-t52.oembed","provider":"Datum Dahleez STORE","version":"1.0","type":"link"}